id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41481::$$$message_0303_0000_0000$$$::"..."::
41482::$$$message_0303_0001_0000$$$::"..."::
41483::$$$message_0303_0002_0000$$$::"Wait, we need to explain."::
41484::$$$message_0303_0003_0000$$$::"O-oh, sorry.[br]These are Sakura Matou's additional standing illustrations."::
41485::$$$message_0303_0004_0000$$$::"Umm, going over each of them..."::
41486::$$$message_0303_0005_0000$$$::"There's the impossible-to-mistake Dinner Date Dress (Left),[lr]::
41487::$$$message_0303_0005_0001$$$::utterly unflattering new variations of the Kyudo Outfit (Right),[lr]::
41488::$$$message_0303_0005_0002$$$::and a not-at-all pitiful Swimsuit (Center)."::
41489::$$$message_0303_0006_0000$$$::"...How merciful of you. You're not nearly as harsh an upperclassman as I expected."::
41490::$$$message_0303_0007_0000$$$::"No way! [l][say storage=ema__15_rin_0041 chara=凛][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01i(中)]How come you can't tell that I'm such a gracious big sister who's desperately searching for a place to land the ICBM I launched on impulse!?"::
41491::$$$message_0303_0008_0000$$$::"The real world contains truly twisted forms of love.[lr]::
41492::$$$message_0303_0008_0001$$$::By the way, the character artist's comment is simply, 'All the new outfits are also sakura colored.'"::
41493::$$$message_0303_0009_0000$$$::"...He's dodging this one."::
41494::$$$message_0303_0010_0000$$$::"I'm not so sure about that. There's no guarantee that she won't have an unexpected spotlight."::
41495::$$$message_0303_0011_0000$$$::"...?"::

